{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月15日 13:30 星期日</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>日本山梨縣河口湖是觀賞富士山的熱門地點。河口湖現正舉行紅葉祭，天朗氣清時，在湖畔散步可細賞富士山，更可拍下紅葉與富士山同框的美景。［河口湖紅葉祭詳情］</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:15:52.308513+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T05:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:23:48.633601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:09:49.272113+00:00","content_hash":"f77c730cffc15001657995f7b5c36db41c9b12b7d3df24b4f36538ca92a3b3bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}